Karma gets you much faster and I feel like how many times is Barney like given a false name had a whole false thing and he just seems to get away with it because he never claimed to be anything different whereas Ted actually the ethics does matter to him he does want to be a good guy he is constitutionally honest and when he tries to deceive Victoria and himself on a huge level and Robin, it boomerang so fast back at him.
因果报应让你更快，我觉得有多少次巴尼就像给了一个假名字，做了一件完全错误的事情，他似乎只是侥幸逃脱了，因为他从来没有声称自己有什么不同，而泰德实际上道德对他来说很重要，他确实想成为一个好人，他本质上是诚实的，当他试图在很大程度上欺骗维多利亚和他自己以及罗宾时，它很快就回到了他身上。

