Barney's building armor starting with that suit and the more bad crap you do, the more you build up your armor I think and when you're the guy that doesn't do the bad stuff and do it once, you get burned and it hits you and there's no armor there and that's kind of what the end of this episode is and why it's why a future into narrator Ted frames the story the way he does.
巴尼从这套衣服开始建造盔甲，你做的越糟糕，我想你的盔甲就越多，当你是那个不做坏事的人，只做了一次，你就会被烧伤，它击中你，那里没有盔甲，这就是这一集的结尾，也是为什么未来的叙述者泰德会像他那样构建故事。

