He gets burned.
他被烧伤了。

00:45:57.110 --> 00:46:06.859
But that's what I mean though about how I met your mother being a moral or ethical universe where you can't get away with it that long.
但这就是我的意思，尽管我是如何遇见你母亲的，在一个道德或伦理的宇宙中，你无法摆脱它那么久。

